    <bpmn:process id="W_W4259" name="W4259. Transport Vendor Invoice, Reconciliation &amp; Settlement" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monthly vendor billing cycle
Frequency: Monthly
Volume: Invoices per vendor (per-trip or monthly charter billing)
Owner: Accounts Payable (VS-15) / Finance (VS-17.4) / Transport Lead
Participants: AP (VS-15), Finance (VS-17.4), Procurement (VS-34), Transport
Source: workflow W4259 — Transport Vendor Invoice, Reconciliation &amp; Settlement</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4259_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4259_Lane1" name="AP">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4259_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4259_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4259_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4259_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4259_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4259_Start3" name="Monthly vendor billing cycle">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4259_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4259_Task4" name="AP/Transport receive the vendor invoice (per-trip manifest count or fixed…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: AP/Transport receive the vendor invoice (per-trip manifest count or fixed monthly charter), match to contracted rates (W4257) and actual trip/ridership records (W4250)
Responsible (R): AP / Transport Lead
Accountable (A): Finance Controller
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4259_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4259_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4259_Task5" name="AP/Finance reconcile discrepancies (unrun trips, SLA penalties W4258…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: AP/Finance reconcile discrepancies (unrun trips, SLA penalties W4258, fuel-index adjustments), apply holdback/penalties, and resolve with the vendor
Responsible (R): AP / Finance / Procurement
Accountable (A): Finance Controller
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4259_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4259_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4259_Task6" name="AP process payment per terms (VS-15 P2P), post to GL/allocation (W4246), and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: AP process payment per terms (VS-15 P2P), post to GL/allocation (W4246), and retain audit evidence (BIR-compliant OR/invoice per VS-79)
Responsible (R): AP / GL (VS-17.1)
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4259_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4259_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4259_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4259_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-127 (ensure employee-transport compliance &amp; vendor settlement.) | - CTL-655: invoice matched to manifest/rate before payment; penalties applied; BIR-compliant invoice retained (VS-79)
Owner: Accounts Payable (VS-15) / Finance (VS-17.4) / Transport Lead</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4259_Assoc9" sourceRef="W4259_Annotation8" targetRef="W4259_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4259_Flow10" sourceRef="W4259_Start3" targetRef="W4259_Task4" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4259_Flow11" sourceRef="W4259_Task4" targetRef="W4259_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4259_Flow12" sourceRef="W4259_Task5" targetRef="W4259_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4259_Flow13" sourceRef="W4259_Task6" targetRef="W4259_End7" />
    </bpmn:process>
