    <bpmn:process id="W_W4260" name="W4260. Transport Compliance Audit, Vehicle Inspection &amp; Insurance/License Registry" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Compliance framework (W4247); periodic cycle; incident (W4255)
Frequency: Periodic audits + continuous registry
Volume: Vehicles, drivers, and vendor crews across the network
Owner: Transport Lead / Compliance (VS-22) / HSE (VS-24) / Fleet (VS-06)
Participants: Compliance (VS-22), HSE (VS-24), Fleet (VS-06), Insurance (VS-26), Legal (VS-100.3)
Source: workflow W4260 — Transport Compliance Audit, Vehicle Inspection &amp; Insurance/License Registry</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4260_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4260_Lane1" name="Fleet">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4260_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4260_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4260_Lane2" name="HSE">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4260_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4260_Lane3" name="Transport">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4260_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4260_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4260_Start5" name="Compliance framework (W4247); periodic cycle; incident (W4255)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4260_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4260_Task6" name="Transport/Fleet maintain the compliance registry (vehicle LTO…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Transport/Fleet maintain the compliance registry (vehicle LTO registration/inspection, franchise, insurance policy/passenger liability, driver license/clearance/medical — own + vendor), with expiry tracking and renewal alerts
Responsible (R): Fleet / Transport / Compliance
Accountable (A): Transport Lead
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4260_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4260_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4260_Task7" name="HSE/Compliance run periodic on-ground audits (vehicle condition, pre-trip W4252…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: HSE/Compliance run periodic on-ground audits (vehicle condition, pre-trip W4252 adherence, no-overload, seat-belt, HSE standard W4254), document findings, and require corrective action
Responsible (R): HSE / Compliance
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4260_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4260_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4260_Task8" name="Transport/Insurance/Legal enforce out-of-service for non-compliant…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Transport/Insurance/Legal enforce out-of-service for non-compliant vehicles/drivers (no service until cured), renew lapsed documents, and log to audit/records (VS-88/VS-24)
Responsible (R): Transport / Insurance / Legal
Accountable (A): COO / CFO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4260_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
