      <bpmn:userTask id="W4262_Task5" name="People Analytics join ridership (W4250) with attendance/time (VS-19.3) and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: People Analytics join ridership (W4250) with attendance/time (VS-19.3) and attrition (VS-19.1) to test correlation (poor commute → absenteeism/lateness/turnover), by site/shift
Responsible (R): People Analytics / Analytics
Accountable (A): Head of HR Shared Services
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
