    <bpmn:process id="W_W4264" name="W4264. Transport Program Performance Review &amp; Reporting" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monthly/quarterly/annual reporting cycle
Frequency: Monthly + annual
Volume: One transport program scorecard for leadership
Owner: Transport Lead / Finance (VS-17.4) / HR (VS-103)
Participants: Analytics (VS-28), HSE (VS-24), EX (VS-103.2), Internal Audit (VS-21)
Source: workflow W4264 — Transport Program Performance Review &amp; Reporting</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4264_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4264_Lane1" name="Transport Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4264_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4264_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4264_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4264_Lane2" name="Transport">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4264_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4264_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4264_Start4" name="Monthly/quarterly/annual reporting cycle">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4264_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4264_Task5" name="Transport/Analytics assemble the program scorecard (cost-per-employee W4261…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Transport/Analytics assemble the program scorecard (cost-per-employee W4261, on-time SLA W4258, safety incidents W4255, ridership/utilization W4250, commute-EX W4248, attrition correlation W4262)
Responsible (R): Transport Lead / Analytics
Accountable (A): COO / CHRO
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4264_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4264_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4264_Task6" name="Transport present the review to leadership (COO/CHRO/CFO), flag risks (safety…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Transport present the review to leadership (COO/CHRO/CFO), flag risks (safety, cost, EX, compliance W4260), and secure decisions/investment
Responsible (R): Transport Lead
Accountable (A): COO / CHRO / CFO
Duration: Monthly/Qtrly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4264_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4264_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4264_Task7" name="Transport/Internal Audit verify program controls (allowance entitlement, vendor…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Transport/Internal Audit verify program controls (allowance entitlement, vendor invoice, compliance registry), report assurance (VS-21), and feed the strategy/budget cycle (W4241/W4246/VS-33)
Responsible (R): Transport / Internal Audit
Accountable (A): COO / CFO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4264_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4264_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4264_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4264_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-127 (ensure employee-transport compliance &amp; vendor settlement.) | - CTL-655: balanced scorecard (cost/safety/EX/compliance); controls audit-assured (VS-21); feeds strategy/budget (VS-33)
Owner: Transport Lead / Finance (VS-17.4) / HR (VS-103)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
